<section class="panel prose">
  <h2>What's in the model</h2>
  <p>
    Default size is a <strong>1220 × 1830 mm</strong> top, <strong>70 mm</strong>
    thick, on <strong>17 mm</strong> plywood. Length and width scale the folding
    linkage; plywood thickness is its own input and does not scale with the top.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Black cart: side plates, front/back, bin floor, casters</li>
    <li>Five 50 mm stretchers — three in the cart, two between the folding legs</li>
    <li>A pair of folding legs at the second hinge</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Rebuild the 3D and DXFs in FreeCAD by editing the knobs at the bottom of
    <code>folding_table.py</code>.
  </p>
</section>

